        "lyrics": "N7ab narja3lek mada biya\nAma tawa lwa9t s3ib s3ib s3ib\nF3id miladi anti hdiya\nTmanit bjambi tkoun 9rib 9rib 9rib\nN7ab narja3lek mada biya\nAma tawa lwa9t s3ib s3ib s3ib\nF3id miladi anti hdiya\nTmanit bjambi tkoun 9rib 9rib 9rib\n\nDenya bla bik dlam\nMafamech dmou3\nMayewfach leklam\nInsan wmanich masno3\nKan tchouf la7lam\nMachi blach rjo3\nBarcha nas ta3tini foji3a\nNo manich mawjou3\n\nOtlobni matalan\nChnowa 7walek lasmar\nTawa kolha ba3det wensatni\nTawa wa7di nashar\nTfekarni matalan\nAnti balak tesbar\nAna rani nkhamem fi omi\nAch khalani neskot\n\n\nAch khalani neskot net7amel\nMenkom net3alem\nNed7ak net2alem\nWana klami kharej melgalb\nGhalet netkalem\n3lihom ma t3amar\nAnti li tfalem\nWenmout wel7a9i mansalem\n\nTwa7achtek matalan\nMates2alch belbarcha\nBalak ghodwa terja3\nKhalitni nkhamem felkharja\nTfaker matalan\nKont n7abek barcha\nBalak tawa nsit\nWtetsawer ana bach nensa\n\nN7ab narja3lek mada biya\nAma tawa lwa9t s3ib s3ib s3ib\nF3id miladi anti hdiya\nTmanit bjambi tkoun 9rib 9rib 9rib\nN7ab narja3lek mada biya\nAma tawa lwa9t s3ib s3ib s3ib\nF3id miladi anti hdiya\nTmanit bjambi tkoun 9rib 9rib 9rib\n\n\nTwa7acht lama wes7abi\nTwa7acht l3ila we9rabi\nYnesouni fi ta3bi\nWeli ba3ni ykhoun li ba3di\nMardi khtir no mech ya3di\nN7awel bach nowfi bwa3di\nNed7ak fi ta3bi\nNchouf fi tsawer soghri yzid la3bi\n\nWana mchit beniya\n3andi 7ouma wsiya\nN3ich fe3riba nta3ab fik\nYa, jomhour mab3adch 3iya\nKol sba7 we3chiya wrak 7wem tedrob 3lik\nKan kida9et bik denya\nDi9ek jemla mata7kihch\nKan ma 7aset bik bnaya\nY7abo lghonya mais ma3lich\nMech kitakhser mal denya\nBous le7nina wmatebkich\nFama nas nsatni ftanya\n3id miladi lyoum lamit\n\nTwa7achtek omi wekhwati\nBaba fdahri kitwati\nNwasi fgalbi weskati\nMansit lcouba wekhwati\nMansal BOURGUIBA , ti bladi\nRapi wsoghri wendadi\n7 snin wmoch 3adi\nL'album taw yahbet katwali\n\n\nN7ab narja3lek mada biya\nAma tawa lwa9t s3ib s3ib s3ib\nF3id miladi anti hdiya\nTmanit bjambi tkoun 9rib